    "windowPhilosophy": "Windows are individually legible architectural openings, grouped by real facade systems. Mix tall office glazing, horizontal ribbon windows, recessed apartment windows, corner glass and occasional warm interior rooms. Preserve visible window frames and floor divisions.",
